### Runs - List
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/runs?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Runs - List filtered
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/runs?type=prototype&status_filter=completed
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Runs - Export PPTX
POST {{apiRoot}}/api/runs/export-pptx
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"workflow_id": "{{workflowId}}",
	"title": "Exported Deck"
}

### Runs - Get by ID
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/runs/{{workflowId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Runs - Delete by ID
DELETE {{apiRoot}}/api/runs/{{workflowId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Runs - Chain context
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/runs/{{workflowId}}/chain-context
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Runs - Artifacts tree
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/runs/{{workflowId}}/artifacts
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Runs - Artifacts by kind
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/runs/{{workflowId}}/artifacts?kind=clarifications&include=content
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Runs - Events stream history
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/runs/{{workflowId}}/events?after=0
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Runs - Revision family
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/runs/{{workflowId}}/family
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Runs - Hook runs
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/runs/{{workflowId}}/hook-runs
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
